<p>Release the bellows of the forge upon your surroundings, inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">29, 40, 47, 54, 60</acronym> mind damage, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">29, 40, 47, 54, 60</acronym> burning damage, and knocking back your enemies in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> cone.</p><p>Empty terrain may be changed (50% chance) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns into forge walls, which block movement and inflict <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">2.68, 3.61, 4.33, 4.94, 5.48</acronym> mind and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">2.68, 3.61, 4.33, 4.94, 5.48</acronym> fire damage on nearby enemies.</p><p>The damage and knockback chance will scale with your Mindpower.</p>